$ whycant read /srv/a

✗ alice (uid 1000) cannot read /srv/a

  /        drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv     drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv/b   lrwxrwxrwx  root:root  ✓ → a
  /srv/a   lrwxrwxrwx  root:root  ✗ too many levels of symbolic links   ← blocked here

Why
  Resolving the path followed more than 40 symbolic links when it reached
  /srv/a, so there is probably a loop.
